{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding (pca_n2000) without image data or fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 score of 0.4639 suggest moderate baseline performance for RNA-only approaches. The results establish a reference point for multimodal comparisons but remain uncertain regarding the impact of alternative encodings or aggregation methods due to limited comparative evidence."
}

